AGA-PISTORM is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 only
(GPL-2.0-only). The full text is in COPYING.

Rationale: the chipset core contains code from UAE and WinUAE, both GPL (Bernd
Schmidt, Alessandro Bissacco, Toni Wilen and the other UAE authors) - some of
it copied, more of it translated into C, much of it the older UAE code kept in
E-UAE. The header of each file in core/src says what it took and carries the
copyright lines of the files it came from; package/UAE-WinUAE-notice.txt
collects them. The kernel combines it with Emu68 (MPL-2.0, Michal Schulz):
MPL-2.0 section 3.3 allows that combination, the kernel as a whole is
distributed under the GPL-2.0, and Emu68's own files keep their MPL-2.0
notices.

Under the MPL-2.0 instead (full text in MPL-2.0.txt):
  arm/emu68-aga.patch     our changes to Emu68's files - MPL-2.0, like the
                          files they change
  package/videocore-src/  our changes to Emu68-tools' VideoCore.card: the
                          diff, overlay.c and version_gen.h.in
  package/overlays-src/   logo.dts, Emu68's logo-colour overlay (Michal Schulz)
